{
    "title": "Yousician: Learn Guitar & Bass",
    "description": "YOUSICIAN is the fast, fun way to learn, play and master the Guitar, Bass or Singing/Vocals. Yousicians around the world can master their instruments or learn to sing thousands of songs in a fun and easy way!\r\n\r\nYousician is your personal music teacher. Tune your strings, warm up your voice, and learn with interactive guitar and singing lessons that teach as you play. Start playing and get instant feedback so you make sure to hit the right chords and notes.\r\n\r\nWith Yousician you can start learning songs from some of your favorite artists including the all new Billie Collection. Learn your favorite Billie Eilish songs, from \u201cbad guy\u201d and \u201cocean eyes\u201d to all 10 tracks from Billie\u2019s new album \u2018HIT ME HARD AND SOFT.\r\n\r\nOur learning path, designed by expert music teachers, will help musicians of all levels improve, from complete beginners to professionals. Jump into step-by-step videos that let you learn at your own pace. Nail each bass and guitar chord through fun gameplay that tracks your progress and keeps you motivated. Refine your vocals with singing lessons packed with easy-to-follow instructions that make practicing simple and enjoyable.\r\n\r\nSo grab your guitar or bass, and prepare those vocal chords. It\u2019s time to make music!\r\n\r\nWHO IS YOUSICIAN FOR?\r\n\u2022 Guitarists, Bass players & Singers\r\n\u2022 Complete beginners\r\n\u2022 Self-learners\r\n\u2022 Advanced & professional musicians\r\n\u2022 Music teachers\r\n\r\nYOUSICIAN FEATURES\r\n\r\nLEARN GUITAR & BASS SEAMLESSLY\r\n- Learn to play chords and discover guitar tabs for songs with step-by-step tutorials\r\n- Learn sheet music, guitar chord finger placement, proper strumming, melodies, lead, fingerpicking and more\r\n- Play bass and master your instrument with a fun, interactive music teacher\r\n- Yousician even has a guitar tuner so you can start your lesson off right and join countless musicians\r\n- Our gamified learning makes playing instruments fun\r\n\r\nLEARN TO SING EASILY\r\n- Our virtual vocal coach has interactive lessons that listen as you practice\r\n- Refine your vocals in singing lessons with instant feedback\r\n- Learn to sing and discover your singing potential\r\n\r\nLESSONS FOR EVERY MUSICIAN\r\n- From bass and guitar to singing lessons \u2013 Yousician has you covered\r\n- Get over 10,000 lessons, exercises and songs by artists you love\r\n- Guitar chord progressions and music theory for every skill level\r\n\r\nDISCOVER THE BILLIE COLLECTION\r\n- Explore 25+ songs by Billie Eilish\r\n- Play hit songs like \u201cbad guy\u201d and \u201cocean eyes\u201d\r\n- Learn all 10 songs from Billie\u2019s new album \u2018HIT ME HARD AND SOFT\u2019\r\n\r\nStart your free trial today and experience all we have to offer!\r\n\r\nPREMIUM SUBSCRIPTION\r\nSubscribe for unlimited and uninterrupted playtime across all platforms. Subscription types are annual plans billed in monthly installments, upfront annual and monthly plans. Prices may vary in different countries. Subscription automatically renews at the end of each term unless auto-renew is turned off in your Yousician account on yousician.com. If you use a Google Play store account, you can cancel your subscription from there.\r\n\r\nWHAT PEOPLE ARE SAYING ABOUT YOUSICIAN\r\n\u201cYousician is modern technology's gift to music education. It\u2019s an app that teaches you to master the guitar instead of a plastic game controller.\u201d - Guitar World\r\n\r\n\u201cYousician is a fabulous place to start learning piano, guitar, ukulele or bass. Yousician teaches basic playing techniques and musical notation by presenting a challenge and then listening as you try to play in real life.\u201d - New York Times\r\n\r\nABOUT YOUSICIAN\r\nYousician is the world\u2019s leading platform to learn and play music. With a combined 20 million monthly users across our award-winning apps, we\u2019re on a mission to make musicality as common as literacy.\r\n\r\nCheck out our other apps:\r\n\u2022 GuitarTuna, the #1 guitar tuner app worldwide\r\n\u2022 Ukulele by Yousician\r\n\u2022 Piano by Yousician\r\n\r\nGot ideas to make Yousician even better? Simply send your ideas and suggestions to: feedback.yousician.com\r\n\u2022 https://yousician.com/privacy-notice\r\n\u2022 https://yousician.com/terms-of-service",
    "descriptionHTML": "YOUSICIAN is the fast, fun way to learn, play and master the Guitar, Bass or Singing/Vocals. Yousicians around the world can master their instruments or learn to sing thousands of songs in a fun and easy way!<br><br>Yousician is your personal music teacher. Tune your strings, warm up your voice, and learn with interactive guitar and singing lessons that teach as you play. Start playing and get instant feedback so you make sure to hit the right chords and notes.<br><br>With Yousician you can start learning songs from some of your favorite artists including the all new Billie Collection. Learn your favorite Billie Eilish songs, from \u201cbad guy\u201d and \u201cocean eyes\u201d to all 10 tracks from Billie\u2019s new album \u2018HIT ME HARD AND SOFT.<br><br>Our learning path, designed by expert music teachers, will help musicians of all levels improve, from complete beginners to professionals. Jump into step-by-step videos that let you learn at your own pace. Nail each bass and guitar chord through fun gameplay that tracks your progress and keeps you motivated. Refine your vocals with singing lessons packed with easy-to-follow instructions that make practicing simple and enjoyable.<br><br>So grab your guitar or bass, and prepare those vocal chords. It\u2019s time to make music!<br><br>WHO IS YOUSICIAN FOR?<br>\u2022 Guitarists, Bass players &amp; Singers<br>\u2022 Complete beginners<br>\u2022 Self-learners<br>\u2022 Advanced &amp; professional musicians<br>\u2022 Music teachers<br><br>YOUSICIAN FEATURES<br><br>LEARN GUITAR &amp; BASS SEAMLESSLY<br>- Learn to play chords and discover guitar tabs for songs with step-by-step tutorials<br>- Learn sheet music, guitar chord finger placement, proper strumming, melodies, lead, fingerpicking and more<br>- Play bass and master your instrument with a fun, interactive music teacher<br>- Yousician even has a guitar tuner so you can start your lesson off right and join countless musicians<br>- Our gamified 